OL,3,GNEWSAPrepper has 'enough food to last
OL,4,Afor 12 months'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdvice was issued by the government
OL,7,Flast week in a bid to encourage us all
OL,8,Fto stock up on supplies in case of a
OL,9,Fnational emergency.
OL,11,FThey said households should have three
OL,12,Fdays' supply to make sure they have
OL,13,Fwhat they need to get through any
OL,14,F"rocky" periods.
OL,16,FOne man who needs no telling to prepare
OL,17,Fis forager and gardener Shane whose
OL,18,Fterraced house on a quiet Forest of
OL,19,FDean street looks like any other.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
