OL,3,GNEWSAPrepper has 'enough food to last
OL,4,Afor 12 months'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut behind his front door there are
OL,7,Fhundreds of jars, bottles and packets
OL,8,Fof food stacked high and hidden in
OL,9,Fevery room.
